<view class="notice-detail safe-page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="page-wrap loading">
    <view class="skeleton line"></view>
    <view class="skeleton line short"></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{!notice}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-title serif">这条通知不存在</view>
    <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="notice-head {{notice.type}}">
      <view class="notice-label">{{notice.type === 'emergency' ? '紧急通知' : '校方通知'}}</view>
      <view class="notice-title serif">{{notice.title}}</view>
      <view class="notice-source">{{notice.source}} · {{notice.dateText}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="page-wrap notice-body-wrap">
      <view class="notice-body">{{notice.body}}</view>

      <view class="notice-meta card">
        <view class="meta-row">
          <text>发布来源</text>
          <text>{{notice.source}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="meta-row">
          <text>有效期至</text>
          <text>{{notice.effectiveTo}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="meta-row">
          <text>通知类型</text>
          <text>{{notice.type === 'emergency' ? '紧急 · 首页顶部' : '校方普通通知'}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{notice.type === 'emergency'}}" class="notice-tip">
        紧急通知只挂首页顶部；如信息有误，平台会发布更正说明，不悄悄删除。
      </view>

      <view class="notice-foot">
        <text>校方通知 · 请以学校最新信息为准</text>
        <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="goHome">返回首页</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
